type: dataset
title: "Ancient DNA samples by find spot"
abstract: "An interactive map of about 22,000 ancient human genomes by find spot, with dates, sex, Y-DNA (placed on FamilyTreeDNA's tree) and mtDNA haplogroups, and corrections to AADR from the publishing papers."
